<aside><div class="panel-heading"><span class="tune-icon">☷</span><div><h2>Shape your garden</h2><p>A little nudge can change everything.</p></div></div><div class="preset-section"><label>START WITH A FEELING <span>✦</span></label><select id="preset"><option value="balanced">🌱 &nbsp; Balanced garden</option><option value="rich">🍏 &nbsp; Fruit-rich garden</option><option value="red">🔴 &nbsp; Red-heavy garden</option><option value="fragile">🪷 &nbsp; Fragile balance</option><option value="low">🌾 &nbsp; Low-fruit garden</option></select><p id="preset-description">A little of everything. Room for everyone.</p></div><div id="controls"></div><div class="panel-bottom"><button id="randomize">⚄ &nbsp; Surprise me</button><p>Changes take root as the garden runs.</p></div></aside></main>
<dialog id="guide-modal"><button id="close-guide" class="close-guide" aria-label="Close field guide">×</button><div class="eyebrow">A POCKET FIELD GUIDE</div><h2>Everything is connected.</h2><p>Fruit feeds the blue gatherers. Blue blobs give energy to the red chasers through a gentle contact. Every little move costs energy.</p><div class="guide-cycle">🌳 <span>→</span> 🔵 <span>→</span> 🔴</div><p>With enough stored energy, a blob can split into two. When energy runs out, it quietly fades. Fruit regrows after a rest, giving the garden another chance.</p><p><b>Try this:</b> increase fruit growth and watch the blue population respond first. Then see if the reds catch up.</p><p>Drag the world to turn it. Click any blob to meet it. Settings apply live; starting populations and the seed apply when you reset.</p><button id="guide-done" class="primary">Let'"'s grow something</button></dialog><script type=\"module\" src=\"app.js\"></script></body></html>
EOF
